Z||000008||stimpy||05-14-2001||02:36 PM||||Well. The bbq is paid for out of entry fees. 3 free heads eating does make it a bit unfair for people who paid, but I'd think if y'all donated some beverages or cash, it should be cool. Make sense?||||reg||1
