Z||000015||mrfiero||05-19-2001||01:54 AM||||Well it looks like I won't be able to attend afterall.  My GT started giving me fits today.....I replaced the TCC, which pooped out last year when I had a little over 14K miles on it, then it started sputtering.  I think I have some fouled plugs or something (maybe even a bad catalytic convertor....let's hope not!).<P>At any rate......I hope to make at least one regional show this year (maybe the Dell's?)<P>I hope everything goes well and the weather cooperates.....it's been raining cats & dogs (major thunderstorm) for the past couple of hours, so it's headed your way.  Hopefully it clears up before the show starts.    ||||reg||8
