Z||000018||stimpy||05-19-2001||07:09 PM||||Well, just got home. It was a good time.  It actually wound down around 1 pm. We met back up for the BBQ at 4pm under thunderclouds. We left that pretty quickly. We were well represented by forum members, with Cheever2 and Curtis showing up. Chuck (Cheever) won first place in stock coupe, I took second in modified fastback. Curtis didn't have a car there (next year, right?). <BR>Hopefully, we will get together for an event again this year. If we do, I'll be sure to post about it. Keep your eye on the forum! Next year will be our 10th anniversery meet. We're gonna make it kick ass, so start making plans now, cuz we are!||||reg||6
Z||000019||sqoach||05-19-2001||08:55 PM||||I didn't get to make it. I was on my way there, had to stop for a minute, and that's when my car decides it doesn't want to go any further. And since it looked like it was gonna rain, I figured it would just be best to go back.<P>Me and my friend had some fun on the way back at least. We took the sunroof off, and he stuck his head out as people passed by. It was pretty funny. We also picked up a turtle that was just sitting in the middle of the road. Had to save the poor thing  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I hope next year I'll have a decent mode of transportation.||||reg||9
Z||000020||curtis||05-19-2001||10:14 PM||||Yes next year, Stimpy. I still had fun though. There were some nice ones. It was nice to meet some forum members finally also.||||reg||9
